v 3
d frlinkck: report merge-style match dispositions after frlink
d
d frlinkck reports, for an existing frlink linkage, the three match
d dispositions that merge reports and frlink does not: master only,
d using only, and matched. It can halt a do-file when the dispositions
d are not the ones claimed, using merge's own assert() keywords, and it
d can put the unmatched records from either side into a new frame.
d
d It takes only the name of the link variable; the frames, the match
d variables and the match type are read from the link variable itself.
d
d Also reports on links created by framerge 1:1 and m:1.
d
d KW: data management
d KW: frames
d KW: frlink
d KW: merge
d
d Requires Stata 16 or later.
d
d Author: Marshall Garland
d Support: email garlandm@usc.edu
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261105
d
f frlinkck.ado
f frlinkck.sthlp
